    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\" font-size:14px; font-weig"
"ht:600;\">1. </span><span style=\" font-size:14px; font-weight:600;\">Comment"
" out the subsystem, if you want to use another subsystem (as the Tag are comm"
"on and PLECS doesnt allow subsystem with another Tag).</span></p>\n<p><span s"
"tyle=\" font-size:14px; font-weight:600;\">2. The values of L and C are writt"
"en in ohms for simplification of the system. The codes will give you conducti"
"on angle, external angle, Vdc (work out the digitised state, accordingly).</s"
"pan></p>\n<p><span style=\" font-size:14px; font-weight:600;\">3. To understa"
"nd this simulation model read paper presented by Bharat Vardani and Duleepa T"
"hrimawithana on IEEE.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\" font-size:14px; font-weig"
"ht:600;\">4. Message on bvar321@aucklanduni.ac.nz if need any help regarding "
"the model. </span></p></body></html>"
